# Reference traces are byte-exact artifacts, not text.
#
# The golden suite compares them byte-for-byte against what scena-run writes,
# and scena-run writes LF on every platform deliberately. Without this, git's
# end-of-line translation would rewrite the committed references to CRLF on a
# Windows checkout and every scenario would "differ in trailing bytes" while
# every number matched — which is exactly what CI reported before this file.
*.csv -text
*.json -text
